OL,3,AUK Youth Parliament looks set to be
OL,4,Aaxed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK Youth Parliament is at risk of
OL,7,Fbeing axed within months, BBC News has
OL,8,Flearned, as the government is not
OL,9,Fcommitting to funding it any longer.
OL,11,FThe parliament was launched in 2000 to
OL,12,Fboost interest in politics among young
OL,13,Fpeople and has more than 300 elected
OL,14,Fmembers aged between 11 and 18.
OL,16,FOnce a year, the young politicians are
OL,17,Fallowed to hold debates in the House of
OL,18,FCommons chamber, on a day when MPs are
OL,19,Fnot sitting.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
